 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A little pinch of salt makes the dinner taste so good",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A little candle shines in the dark the way it should",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus looked at all his friends sitting on the hill",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he told them who they are and he tells us still",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You are the salt of the earth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You are the light of the world",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A city set on a hill cannot be hidden",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shine, shine, shine",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No one lights a lamp and puts it under a basket",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They set it on a stand",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And it gives light to everyone in the house",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So hold your little light up high in your hand",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You are the salt of the earth",
